<!-- lean-spec:begin -->
# lean-spec

Use `.lean-spec/runtime/bin/lean-spec` as the only writer of lean-spec state.
Do not edit `.lean-spec/features/*/workflow.json` or `.lean-spec/auto.json` directly.
Read the installed `.agents/skills/lean-spec-*/SKILL.md` instructions before running a lifecycle step.
Before launching a lean-spec architect, coder, or reviewer subagent, run
`.lean-spec/runtime/bin/lean-spec dispatch prepare <slug> <role>`. The
SubagentStart hook binds the resulting Codex agent ID. Do not write
`.lean-spec/dispatch.json` yourself. If the launch fails before the hook binds
an agent ID, run `.lean-spec/runtime/bin/lean-spec dispatch cancel` before
trying again.
<!-- lean-spec:end -->
